{"ticker":"SWKS","updated":"2026-10-24T00:14:35Z","profile":{"longName":"Skyworks Solutions, Inc.","shortName":"Skyworks Solutions, Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Semiconductors","country":"United States","website":"https://www.skyworksinc.com","fullTimeEmployees":10000,"marketCap":19619862528,"trailingPE":43.22798,"forwardPE":14.168703,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":4.8877363,"pegRatio":1.7,"targetMeanPrice":77.50588,"targetHighPrice":107.0,"targetLowPrice":61.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":17,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":-0.031,"earningsGrowth":-0.686,"grossMargins":0.40734002,"operatingMargins":0.08825,"profitMargins":0.072270006,"totalRevenue":4014099968,"beta":1.478,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":92.8,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":51.93,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Skyworks Solutions, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, develops, manufactures, and markets analog and mixed-signal semiconductor products and solutions in the United States, Taiwan, China, South Korea, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, and the Asia Pacific. The company offers amplifiers, antenna tuners, attenuators, automotive tuners and digital radios, wireless ASoC, DC/DC converters, demodulators, detectors, digital power isolators, diodes, directional couplers, diversity receive modules, filters, front-end modules, hybrids, light emitting diode drivers, low noise amplifiers, mixers, modulators, and optocouplers/optoisolators. It also provides phase locked loops, phase shifters, power dividers/combiners, power over ethernet, power isolators, ProSLIC family of subscriber line interface circuits, receivers, system in package, switches, synthesizers, timing devices, voltage-controlled oscillators/synthesizers, and voltage regulators. The company sells its products through direct sales force, electronic component distributors, and independent sales representatives. Its products are used in aerospace, automotive, broadband, cellular infrastructure, connected home, defense, entertainment and gaming, industrial, medical, smartphone, tablet, and wearables applications. The company was founded in 1962 and is headquartered in Irvine, California.","summary_zh":"Skyworks Solutions, Inc. 及其子公司在美國、台灣、中國、韓國、歐洲、中東、非洲和亞太地區開發、製造和銷售模擬和混合訊號半導體產品和解決方案。該公司提供放大器、天線調諧器、衰減器、汽車調諧器和數位收音機、無線 ASoC、DC/DC 轉換器、解調器、檢測器、數位電源隔離器、二極管、定向耦合器、分集接收模組、濾波器、前端模組、混合器、發光二極體驅動器、低噪聲放大器、混頻器、調變放大器/隔離器驅動器/隔離器驅動器/隔離器驅動器/隔離器驅動器。它還提供鎖相環、移相器、功率分配器/組合器、乙太網路供電、電源隔離器、ProSLIC 系列用戶線介面電路、接收器、系統級封裝、開關、合成器、計時器件、壓控振盪器/合成器和電壓調節器。該公司透過直銷隊伍、電子元件分銷商和獨立銷售代表銷售其產品。其產品用於航空航太、汽車、寬頻、蜂窩基礎設施、互聯家庭、國防、娛樂和遊戲、工業、醫療、智慧型手機、平板電腦和穿戴式設備應用。該公司成立於 1962 年，總部位於加州歐文。","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"半導體","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":77.14,"h":77.39,"l":76.45,"c":76.76,"v":1869700},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":76.0,"h":77.06,"l":75.64,"c":75.67,"v":2814400},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":75.49,"h":76.35,"l":75.13,"c":76.2,"v":1529900},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":76.17,"h":76.53,"l":74.85,"c":75.1,"v":1869000},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":74.65,"h":75.61,"l":74.47,"c":74.94,"v":2234400},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":72.98,"h":73.91,"l":71.56,"c":73.07,"v":2210300},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":73.26,"h":73.72,"l":72.63,"c":73.56,"v":2419800},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":73.03,"h":74.71,"l":72.19,"c":74.64,"v":2279600},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":74.88,"h":76.38,"l":74.58,"c":75.2,"v":2138400},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":75.27,"h":75.68,"l":73.57,"c":75.63,"v":2196000},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":75.63,"h":76.74,"l":74.58,"c":75.06,"v":2290500},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":75.06,"h":75.08,"l":72.09,"c":73.6,"v":2820600},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":74.22,"h":74.81,"l":72.98,"c":74.68,"v":3423800},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":74.4,"h":74.6,"l":73.01,"c":74.46,"v":2140400},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":74.4,"h":75.54,"l":72.48,"c":72.87,"v":2660000},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":73.48,"h":74.6,"l":73.22,"c":74.22,"v":2744600},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":74.33,"h":75.42,"l":73.06,"c":74.49,"v":2413700},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":75.84,"h":77.47,"l":75.38,"c":77.03,"v":3356900},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":77.94,"h":